{"suttaId":"tha-ap228","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7887,7902],"vripara":"29"},"segments":{"tha-ap228:0.3":"Aṅkolapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap228:1.1":"“Nārado [varado (ka.)] iti me nāmaṃ, kassapo iti maṃ vidū;","tha-ap228:1.3":"Addasaṃ samaṇānaggaṃ, vipassiṃ devasakkataṃ.","tha-ap228:2.1":"“Anubyañjanadharaṃ buddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ;","tha-ap228:2.3":"Aṅkolapupphaṃ [vakulapupphaṃ (syā.), bakolapupphaṃ (ka.)] paggayha, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ.","tha-ap228:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap228:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap228:4.1":"“Catusattatito kappe, romaso nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap228:4.3":"Āmukkamālābharaṇo, sayoggabalavāhano.","tha-ap228:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap228:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā aṅkolapupphiyo [vakulapupphiyo (syā.), bakolapupphiyo (ka.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap228:7.1":"Aṅkolapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
